## 3. RESTful API Design

### HTTP Methods

**GET**: Retrieve resources
```csharp
[HttpGet]
public async Task<IActionResult> GetVessels()
{
    return await ExecuteOperationAsync(async () =>
    {
        var vessels = await _maritimeDataService.GetFleet();
        return vessels;
    }, nameof(GetVessels));
}
```

**POST**: Create resources
```csharp
[HttpPost]
public async Task<IActionResult> CreateVessel([FromBody] CreateVesselRequest request)
{
    return await ExecuteOperationAsync(async () =>
    {
        var vessel = await _vesselService.CreateVesselAsync(request);
        return vessel;
    }, nameof(CreateVessel));
}
```

**PUT**: Update resources (full update)
```csharp
[HttpPut("{id}")]
public async Task<IActionResult> UpdateVessel(int id, [FromBody] UpdateVesselRequest request)
{
    return await ExecuteOperationAsync(async () =>
    {
        var vessel = await _vesselService.UpdateVesselAsync(id, request);
        return vessel;
    }, nameof(UpdateVessel));
}
```

**PATCH**: Partial update
```csharp
[HttpPatch("{id}")]
public async Task<IActionResult> PatchVessel(int id, [FromBody] JsonPatchDocument<Vessel> patch)
{
    return await ExecuteOperationAsync(async () =>
    {
        var vessel = await _vesselService.PatchVesselAsync(id, patch);
        return vessel;
    }, nameof(PatchVessel));
}
```

**DELETE**: Delete resources
```csharp
[HttpDelete("{id}")]
public async Task<IActionResult> DeleteVessel(int id)
{
    return await ExecuteOperationAsync(async () =>
    {
        await _vesselService.DeleteVesselAsync(id);
        return NoContent();
    }, nameof(DeleteVessel));
}
```

